:INFO
Art. 27 Exceptions from the licensing requirement
Authorisation is not required for putting the following into circulation:
a. plant reproductive material in accordance with Article 14a of the Seeds Ordinance of 7 December 1998;
b. animal feedstuffs in accordance with Article 21b Feedstuffs Ordinance of 26 May 1999;
c. foodstuffs, if the requirements of Article 23 of the Foodstuffs and Utility Articles Ordinance of 23 November 2005 have been fulfilled.
|

:NOTE
let. a — SR 916.151
