let. c — [AS 2005 5451; 2006 4909; 2007 1469 Annex 4 No 47; 2008 789 4377 Annex 5 No 8 5167 6025; 2009 1611; 2010 4611; 2011 5273 Art. 37 5803 Annex 2 No II 3; 2012 4713 6809; 2013 3041 No I 7 3669; 2014 1691 Annex 3 No II 4 2073 Annex 11 No 3; 2015 5201 Annex No II 2; 2016 277 Annex No 5. AS 2017 283 Art. 94para. 1]. See now the O of 16 Dec. 2016 (SR 817.02).
